#* {{quote-journal|en|date=May 20, 1962|author=w:William Melvin Kelley|title=If You’re Woke You Dig It|work=The New York Times|page=45|url=https://www.nytimes.com/1962/05/20/archives/if-youre-woke-you-dig-it-no-mickey-mouse-can-be-expected-to-follow.html|passage=If You’re '''Woke''' You Dig It [title]}}
