#* {{quote-song|en|year=2008|author=w:Erykah Badu|title=Master Teacher|album=w:New Amerykah Part One (4th World War)|passage=What if there was no niccas / Only master teachers? / I stay '''woke''' (dreams dreams)}}
#* {{quote-book|en|title=WomanSpeak, A Journal of Writing and Art by Caribbean Women|passage={{...}} stay '''woke'''[,] people of color, / let us occupy this dissent|author=Sweeting, Lynn|year=2014|volume=7}}
# {{senseid|en|left-wing}} {{lb|en|by extension|politics|slang|often|derogative}} Holding [[progressive]] [[view]]s or [[attitude]]s, principally with regard to [[social justice]].
